Package: powerballtools
Title: Tools for Exploring Powerball Lottery Draws
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Andrew",
           family = "Burson",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "aburson1@usf.edu")
Description: Helper functions and data to explore historical Powerball
    lottery drawings. Includes the pb_draws dataset with draw dates,
    winning numbers, and multipliers from 2010 onward, plus tools to
    summarise number frequencies, generate example tickets, and check
    how a ticket would have performed.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports:
    ggplot2
