RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Suggests: 
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://github.com/dburson98/powerballtools
BugReports: https://github.com/dburson98/powerballtools/issues
